      "subtitle": "视频片段跟读 · 按提供顺序保留 8 个片段，另附 1 句；未补全缺失内容。",
      "duration": 29.328,
      "voice": "美式女声 · Jenny",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "id": "p01",
          "text": "I used to consider myself a rather",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-01.mp3",
            "sha256": "fa3a7473ad7c9603328838aea5fb167b2b82098c40ae61a8505243281d2ff115"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "consider",
              "ipa": "kənˈsɪdɚ",
              "meaning": "认为；把……看作"
            },
            {
              "word": "rather",
              "ipa": "ˈræðɚ",
              "meaning": "相当；颇（此处后文缺失）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p02",
          "text": "and I feel intimidated by big changes",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-02.mp3",
            "sha256": "4137406e9f493cc84c6af19d62587885597b4086d35c398ea255520d7e33a121"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "intimidated",
              "ipa": "ɪnˈtɪmədeɪtɪd",
              "meaning": "感到畏惧的；被吓住的"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p03",
          "text": "or I want to throw an elaborate",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-03.mp3",
            "sha256": "1327442e37f458b07e8b0beeeedfcc4690774734036f796cdbbe82732cfcebde"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "elaborate",
              "ipa": "ɪˈlæbərət",
              "meaning": "精心安排的；复杂的（形容词；后面的名词缺失）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p04",
          "text": "but I'm incredibly impatient in all of those ideas",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-04.mp3",
            "sha256": "b76f17e4f3b965e1985225832b5e7e33a6f7b53a3b3f60b515dc0095e897608a"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "incredibly",
              "ipa": "ɪnˈkrɛdəbli",
              "meaning": "非常；难以置信地"
            },
            {
              "word": "impatient",
              "ipa": "ɪmˈpeɪʃənt",
              "meaning": "不耐烦的；急切的"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p05",
          "text": "through the whole process of making things happen",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-05.mp3",
            "sha256": "523ea4f1c66c20fedfc8832fc6c5ab9cea0b2daa2d6b1c9d5e70fc124e6f521b"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "process",
              "ipa": "ˈprɑsɛs",
              "meaning": "过程；流程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p06",
          "text": "collaborator or even a specific client",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-06.mp3",
            "sha256": "47f1fb39ea0b9a06ce9210df8c7ed801a7b5a5924de84c1608b8cdda3660fdd3"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "collaborator",
              "ipa": "kəˈlæbəreɪtɚ",
              "meaning": "合作者；合作伙伴"
            },
            {
              "word": "specific",
              "ipa": "spəˈsɪfɪk",
              "meaning": "特定的；具体的"
            },
            {
              "word": "client",
              "ipa": "ˈklaɪənt",
              "meaning": "客户；委托人"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p07",
          "text": "it's like borrowing someone else's",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-07.mp3",
            "sha256": "147a106e753f4cff7ea0a07e9b6fbee5030c6ca806304ab892a2c66617e46b84"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "borrowing",
              "ipa": "ˈbɑroʊɪŋ",
              "meaning": "借用（borrow 的现在分词）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p08",
          "text": "do smaller things consistently",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
            "path": "small-steps-video-fragments-08.mp3",
            "sha256": "ac6b1d524bf22421837ac495a0332c71cc49e0f4ac5cb8b9cb2eb53770f02eea"
          },
          "vocabulary": [
            {
              "word": "consistently",
              "ipa": "kənˈsɪstəntli",
              "meaning": "持续地；始终如一地"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p09",
          "text": "to give me the structure or something",
          "updatedAt": "2026-11-14",
          "audio": {
